      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.11911010742188,
        230.2843780517578,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Suspected extrapulmonary TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        107.69464111328125,
        513.3799438476562,
        121.046142578125
      ],
      "text": "Table 2 shows the investigations normally used to diagnose the common forms of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        123.691162109375,
        513.4718627929688,
        137.04266357421875
      ],
      "text": "extrapulmonary TB. In most of these cases, TB will be suspected from the clinical picture",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        139.68768310546875,
        373.2294616699219,
        153.0391845703125
      ],
      "text": "and confirmed by histology or other special investigations.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        164.12515258789062,
        138.69837951660156,
        177.545654296875
      ],
      "text": "Other tests",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        188.70062255859375,
        513.46044921875,
        202.0521240234375
      ],
      "text": "Specialized tests, such as computerized chest tomography and bronchoscopy, are not",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        204.6971435546875,
        368.1464538574219,
        218.04864501953125
      ],
      "text": "recommended for the routine diagnosis of TB in children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        229.20367431640625,
        513.4375,
        242.55517578125
      ],
      "text": "Some countries use scoring systems for diagnosing TB in children. However, these",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        245.2001953125,
        513.4144897460938,
        258.55169677734375
      ],
      "text": "systems have rarely been evaluated or validated against a “gold standard”; when they",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        261.19671630859375,
        513.4144897460938,
        274.5482177734375
      ],
      "text": "have been evaluated, they have performed poorly and variably. They perform particularly",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        277.1932373046875,
        513.426025390625,
        290.54473876953125
      ],
      "text": "poorly in children suspected of pulmonary TB (the most common form) and in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        293.18975830078125,
        513.4718627929688,
        306.541259765625
      ],
      "text": "who are also HIV-positive. At this point, therefore, WHO cannot give a recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        309.1172790527344,
        358.7854309082031,
        322.53778076171875
      ],
      "text": "(4) regarding the use of scoring systems to diagnose TB  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.723388671875,
        345.7643127441406,
        403.55535888671875,
        359.98431396484375
      ],
      "text": "Common forms of extrapulmonary TB in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        346.05230712890625,
        124.38739013671875,
        359.98431396484375
      ],
      "text": "Table 2.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        365.2483215332031,
        510.2792663574219,
        374.5843200683594
      ],
      "text": "Note:  All fluid (CSF, pleural, ascetic, joint or pericardial) must be subjected to biochemical analysis (protein and glucose con-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        374.8963317871094,
        306.26336669921875,
        384.184326171875
      ],
      "text": "centrations), cell count, AFB stain and culture whenever possible.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        437.9935302734375,
        506.1492614746094,
        452.9935302734375
      ],
      "text": "Miliary TB (e.g. disseminated) Chest radiograph and lumbar puncture (to test for",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        289.7994079589844,
        449.9935302734375,
        335.3493957519531,
        464.9935302734375
      ],
      "text": "meningitis)",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        471.0035400390625,
        492.64935302734375,
        486.0035400390625
      ],
      "text": "Tuberculous meningitis Lumbar puncture (and imaging where available)",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        492.0135498046875,
        485.9693298339844,
        507.0135498046875
      ],
      "text": "Pleural effusion (older children and  Chest radiograph, pleural tap for biochemical",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        504.0135498046875,
        505.04937744140625,
        519.0135498046875
      ],
      "text": "adolescents) analysis (protein and glucose concentrations), cell",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        289.7994079589844,
        516.0135498046875,
        365.0093688964844,
        531.0135498046875
      ],
      "text": "count and culture",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        537.0235595703125,
        462.60931396484375,
        552.0235595703125
      ],
      "text": "Abdominal TB (e.g. peritoneal) Abdominal ultrasound (3) and ascitic tap",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        558.0335693359375,
        487.0693359375,
        573.0335693359375
      ],
      "text": "Osteoarticular Radiograph of joint/bone, joint tap or synovial",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        289.7994079589844,
        570.0335693359375,
        318.12939453125,
        585.0335693359375
      ],
      "text": "biopsy",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        591.0435791015625,
        419.08935546875,
        606.0435791015625
      ],
      "text": "Pericardial TB Ultrasound and pericardial tap",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
